== Controversy ==
Fan Pan Tae, while popular, is repeatedly questioned about its accuracy.  Internet webboard posters, such as in [[Pantip.com]], has proven that the show was giving wrong answers in many occasions.  A more serious allegation claims that the show is giving unfairly advantages to famous contestants, especially those in the show business, over ordinary people who contest in the same topic (anyone can apply to play the game, regardless of their notability.) Another Workpoint's show, [[Tod Sa Gun Game]], is also criticized of fraudulent.<ref>{{cite web|script-title=th:[กระทู้นอกเรื่อง]...++ปัญญา ยอดแย่ wrokpoint จอมหลอกลวง++|url=http://www.atriumtech.com/cgi-bin/hilightcgi?Home=/home/InterWeb2000&File=/home2/searchdata/Forums2/http/www.pantip.com/cafe/lumpini/topic/L5158776/L5158776.html|date=February 21, 2007|accessdate=September 3, 2016|work=พันทิปดอตคอม|author=โบว์_นัท|language=Thai}}</ref>
However, all of these errors were corrected, and questions that were given wrong answers never aired on TV. Instead, they were scrapped and played another round, with different questions.<ref>{{cite web|script-title=th:เบื้องหลังแฟนพันธุ์แท้ครับ|work=พันทิปดอตคอม|date=May 17, 2007|accessdate=September 3, 2016|author=E-E39A|url=http://topicstock.pantip.com/ratchada/topicstock/2007/05/V5418354/V5418354.html|language=Thai}}</ref><ref>{{cite web|script-title=th:แฟนพันธุ์แท้ นี่เตี๊ยมกันหรือเปล่าครับ คุณคิดไงกัน|work=พันทิปดอตคอม|date=November 4, 2007|accessdate=September 3, 2016|author=Scholarly|url=http://topicstock.pantip.com/chalermthai/topicstock/2007/11/A5986129/A5986129.html|language=Thai}}</ref><ref>{{cite web|script-title=th:แฟนพันธุ์แท้เฉลยผิดรึเปล่า คำถามเรื่องนิวไทป์ของกันดั้มหนะ |work=พันทิปดอตคอม|date=July 21, 2007|accessdate=September 3, 2016|author= HGW|url=http://topicstock.pantip.com/chalermthai/topicstock/2007/07/A5630554/A5630554.html|language=Thai}}</ref>

